# kk: Work around zero-extended 32-bit shift miscompile (Apple FB25499479)
# https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/46565 state=opened
# ### What does this MR do and why?

On Enshrouded this was creating fully black shadows which ideally would be lightened by global illumination. It took two days to find out the exact reason, and here we are. It can be removed if apple fixes it however I doubt on timing. I keep it on my local as it is a big artifact on visuals.

